  "term": "HUD",
  "definition": "HUD refers to HuD, one of a group of neuronal autoantigens known as neuronal nuclear type 1 autoantigens. These immune-related proteins are found in neurons and are commonly linked with cancer-related autoimmune neurologic disorders such as paraneoplastic neurologic syndrome.",
